        <span class="eyebrow">Developer platform</span>
        <h2>A complete API for developers building on Cintexa</h2>
        <p>Every Cintexa platform is API-first. Integrate your tools, automate your workflows, and build on our infrastructure with clean, documented endpoints.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dev-portal-layout" data-reveal>
        <nav class="dev-sidebar" aria-label="API categories">
          <button class="is-active" data-panel="auth">Authentication</button>
          <button data-panel="inventory">Inventory API</button>
          <button data-panel="orders">Orders API</button>
        </nav>
        <div class="dev-content-area">
          <div class="dev-content-panel is-active" id="panel-auth">
            <div class="dev-panel-header">
              <h3>Authentication</h3>
              <span class="endpoint-pill"><span class="method-badge POST">POST</span>/v1/auth/token</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dev-panel-body">
              <div class="code-block">
                <div class="code-block-topbar">
                  <span class="code-block-lang">Shell</span>
                  <button class="code-block-copy" data-copy-target="curl-example">Copy</button>
                </div>
                <pre id="curl-example"><code><span class="tok-comment"># Request a new access token</span>
<span class="tok-kw">curl</span> -X POST https://api.cintexa.com/v1/auth/token \
  -H <span class="tok-str">"Content-Type: application/json"</span> \
  -d <span class="tok-str">'{"client_id":"YOUR_ID","client_secret":"YOUR_SECRET"}'</span></code></pre>
              </div>
              <div class="code-block" style="margin-top:var(--space-3)">
                <div class="code-block-topbar">
                  <span class="code-block-lang">Response</span>
                  <button class="code-block-copy" data-copy-target="json-example">Copy</button>
                </div>
                <pre id="json-example"><code>{
  <span class="tok-key">"access_token"</span>: <span class="tok-str">"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9..."</span>,
  <span class="tok-key">"token_type"</span>:   <span class="tok-str">"Bearer"</span>,
  <span class="tok-key">"expires_in"</span>:   <span class="tok-num">3600</span>,
  <span class="tok-key">"scope"</span>:        <span class="tok-str">"inventory:read inventory:write orders:read"</span>
}</code></pre>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dev-content-panel" id="panel-inventory">
            <div class="dev-panel-header">
              <h3>Inventory API</h3>
              <span class="endpoint-pill"><span class="method-badge GET">GET</span>/v1/inventory/items</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dev-panel-body">
              <table class="spec-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>location_id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Filter by warehouse location</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>low_stock</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>Return only items below threshold</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>limit</code></td><td><code>integer</code></td><td>Results per page (max 100)</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="dev-content-panel" id="panel-orders">
            <div class="dev-panel-header">
              <h3>Orders API</h3>
              <span class="endpoint-pill"><span class="method-badge GET">GET</span>/v1/orders</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dev-panel-body">
              <table class="spec-table">
                <thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>pending · fulfilled · cancelled</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>customer_id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>Filter orders by customer</td></tr>
                  <tr><td><code>date_from</code></td><td><code>date</code></td><td>ISO 8601 start date</td></tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CASE STUDIES ============ -->
  <section class="section case-studies-section" id="case-studies">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Results</span>
        <h2>Real outcomes for real businesses</h2>
        <p>Every Cintexa engagement is measured by its business impact — not just delivery. Here's what that looks like in practice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <article class="case-study-card" data-reveal data-delay="1">
          <span class="tag">Inventory Management</span>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Challenge</span><p>A multi-location retailer managed stock across four warehouses using spreadsheets, leading to regular stockouts during peak periods.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Solution</span><p>Cintexa built a real-time inventory platform with automated reorder triggers, supplier integration, and a mobile stocktake app.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-metric"><span class="metric-num">60%</span><span class="metric-label">Reduction in stockout incidents</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="case-study-card" data-reveal data-delay="2">
          <span class="tag">Software Development</span>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Challenge</span><p>A multi-location service business managed scheduling and invoicing across five disconnected spreadsheets and a legacy desktop tool.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Solution</span><p>Cintexa built a unified operations dashboard with real-time sync, role-based access, and automated invoice generation.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-metric"><span class="metric-num">40%</span><span class="metric-label">Reduction in administrative workload</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="case-study-card" data-reveal data-delay="3">
          <span class="tag">Website Development</span>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Challenge</span><p>An enterprise SaaS marketing site suffered from a confusing funnel and slow page loads on mobile networks.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Solution</span><p>Cintexa rebuilt the site with a CDN-optimized static architecture, restructured funnel, and lazy-loaded media.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-metric"><span class="metric-num">2.5×</span><span class="metric-label">Increase in trial signup conversion</span></div>
        </article>
        <article class="case-study-card" data-reveal data-delay="4">
          <span class="tag">Cloud Infrastructure</span>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Challenge</span><p>A growing e-commerce operation experienced recurring outages during traffic spikes around promotional events.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-row"><span class="ck-label">Solution</span><p>Cintexa migrated the platform to edge-distributed infrastructure with auto-scaling Workers and tuned caching rules.</p></div>
          <div class="case-study-metric"><span class="metric-num">35%</span><span class="metric-label">Reduction in unplanned downtime</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ REVIEWS ============ -->
  <section class="section reviews-section" id="reviews">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head centered" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Client feedback</span>
        <h2>What clients say about working with Cintexa</h2>
        <p>Real reviews from businesses that have worked with us. Worked with us recently? Leave a review below.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-summary" data-reveal>
        <div class="reviews-score-block">
          <span class="reviews-score-num" id="reviews-avg">—</span>
          <span class="star-row" id="reviews-avg-stars" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="reviews-score-count" id="reviews-count">Loading reviews…</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reviews-bars" id="reviews-bars" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-grid" id="reviews-grid"></div>
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--space-6)">
        <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="reviews-load-more" type="button" style="display:none;">Show more reviews</button>
      </div>
      <form class="review-form-card" id="review-form" data-reveal style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
        <h3>Leave a review</h3>
        <div class="star-input" id="review-star-input" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Rating">
          <label data-val="1" title="1 star">★</label>
          <label data-val="2" title="2 stars">★</label>
          <label data-val="3" title="3 stars">★</label>
          <label data-val="4" title="4 stars">★</label>
          <label data-val="5" title="5 stars">★</label>
        </div>
        <input type="hidden" id="review-rating-value" value="0">
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="review-name">Your name</label>
          <input type="text" id="review-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name">
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="review-company">Company (optional)</label>
          <input type="text" id="review-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization">
        </div>
        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="review-text">Your review</label>
          <textarea id="review-text" name="text" required rows="4"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="review-form-status" id="review-form-status" role="status"></div>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block" id="review-submit-btn">Submit review</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ ROADMAP ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="roadmap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head centered" data-reveal>
        <span class="eyebrow">Platform roadmap</span>
        <h2>What's coming to the Cintexa platform</h2>
        <p>We build in public and ship fast. Here's what's live, in development, and planned for the Cintexa platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="roadmap-track">
        <div class="roadmap-phase" data-status="active" data-reveal data-delay="1">
          <div class="roadmap-phase-num">01</div>
          <h3>Core Platform</h3>
          <p>Inventory management, cloud infrastructure, and custom software development — fully live.</p>
          <div class="roadmap-status">Live now</div>
        </div>
        <div class="roadmap-phase" data-status="active" data-reveal data-delay="2">
          <div class="roadmap-phase-num">02</div>
          <h3>Cintexa Intelligence</h3>
          <p>Business intelligence layer with automated reporting, forecasting, and workflow automation.</p>
          <div class="roadmap-status">Live now</div>
        </div>
        <div class="roadmap-phase" data-status="upcoming" data-reveal data-delay="3">
          <div class="roadmap-phase-num">03</div>
          <h3>Mobile Platform</h3>
          <p>Native iOS and Android apps for inventory management, order tracking, and business insights.</p>
          <div class="roadmap-status">Q1 2027</div>
        </div>
        <div class="roadmap-phase" data-status="upcoming" data-reveal data-delay="4">
          <div class="roadmap-phase-num">04</div>
          <h3>Marketplace Integrations</h3>
          <p>One-click connections to Shopify, Amazon, WooCommerce, Xero, and 50+ business platforms.</p>
          <div class="roadmap-status">Q2 2027</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

